Description: Accompanies the texts Time Series for Data Science with R by 
    Woodward, Sadler and Robertson & Applied Time Series Analysis with R, 
    2nd edition by Woodward, Gray, and Elliott. It is helpful for data 
    analysis and for time series instruction. Includes tools for GARCH 
    model comparison and diagnostics.
